#: ../../source/docs/building-for-navio2-on-rpi3.rst:5
#: 06b5ecb8a0f74257a3902b6b0389ecf4
msgid "Building for NAVIO2 on RPi3"
msgstr "在 RPi3 上为 NAVIO2 构建"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-navio2-on-rpi3.rst:8
#: 25616d99f1c547c78b0910d5246e1175
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-navio2-on-rpi3.rst:10
#: dca6c66cfa0d4d328ac9f8048e63d3e4
msgid ""
"These instructions clarify how to build ArduPilot for the Navio2 board on "
"the Navio2's RPi3 board itself using Waf build system. These instructions "
"assume the RPi3 has already been setup according to the manufacturer's (i.e."
" Emlid's) instructions `here <http://docs.emlid.com/navio2/Navio-"
"APM/configuring-raspberry-pi/>`__."
msgstr ""
"这些说明阐述了如何使用 Waf 构建系统，在 Navio2 的 RPi3 板上为 Navio2 飞控板构建 ArduPilot。这些说明假设 RPi3 "
"已按照制造商（即 Emlid）的说明完成配置，详见 `此处 <http://docs.emlid.com/navio2/Navio-"
"APM/configuring-raspberry-pi/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-navio2-on-rpi3.rst:16
#: 9fe15ab2e7f74045878bdf42f7f6f603
msgid ""
"Alternatively you can follow Emlid's instructions on how to build from "
"source found `here <http://docs.emlid.com/navio2/Navio-APM/building-from-"
"sources/>`__."
msgstr ""
"你也可以参考 Emlid 的从源码构建说明，详见 `此处 <http://docs.emlid.com/navio2/Navio-"
"APM/building-from-sources/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-navio2-on-rpi3.rst:21
#: 55102bfa84944d6e91a2b11b88648dcf
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "环境配置"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-navio2-on-rpi3.rst:23
#: f7d6b7271c3c4541be1893bb0f453aad
msgid ""
"Use an ssh terminal program such as `Putty <http://www.putty.org/>`__ to log"
" into the Navio2 board's RPI3."
msgstr "使用 SSH 终端程序（例如 `Putty <http://www.putty.org/>`__）登录 Navio2 板的 RPI3。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:5
#: b67e43959aba4f8fb267734264c37751
msgid "Get git"
msgstr "获取 git"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:3 aa3b342875f644588f2eb64810ac9f42
msgid ""
"Git is a free and open source distributed version control system that is "
"used to manage ArduPilot codebase. Git is available on all major OS "
"platforms, and a variety of tools exist to make it easier to get started."
msgstr ""
"git 是一个免费开源的分布式版本控制系统，用于管理 ArduPilot 代码库。git "
"可在所有主流操作系统平台上使用，并且有多种工具可以帮助你快速上手。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:7 05289d82f93243248be84888e432a36c
msgid "Git command line"
msgstr "git 命令行"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:10 274f4879c6a244fabca45ade6ab14ce0
msgid "Ubuntu"
msgstr "Ubuntu"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:12 0d937d2834ac4213b7a3f7250bfe53cb
msgid "Linux/Ubuntu users can install with apt :"
msgstr "Linux/Ubuntu 用户可通过 apt 安装："

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:14 2b6f1c48787744fd9d8bab6d4792f472
msgid "``sudo apt-get update``"
msgstr "``sudo apt-get update``"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:15 522b84c800f94ebcac44c8b4e2074b0d
msgid "``sudo apt-get install git``"
msgstr "``sudo apt-get install git``"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:16 699cfd73b81e4072a136808708cecb6b
msgid "``sudo apt-get install gitk git-gui``"
msgstr "``sudo apt-get install gitk git-gui``"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:22 3bd8d2b8e2ae4b4a8a630ed4d6e65793
msgid "Windows and other Systems"
msgstr "Windows 及其他系统"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:24 cb7f3267d60d41df8aea419efa5b130f
msgid ""
"download and install from `git-scm.com's download page <http://git-"
"scm.com/downloads>`__"
msgstr "从 `git-scm.com 下载页面 <http://git-scm.com/downloads>`__ 下载并安装"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:27 1dbff66ad89f49d59fead6c631af9095
msgid "Recommended GUI Tools"
msgstr "推荐的 GUI 工具"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:29 79dffb7b3170455d817076f4d063b04b
msgid ""
"The git command line, gitk and git-gui tools are the basics that all users "
"should have installed and are available from a few places."
msgstr "git 命令行、gitk 和 git-gui 是所有用户都应安装的基础工具，可从多个渠道获取。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:31 f7af420e2a0b4cebbc4f75d9bb17612e
msgid ""
"A comprehensive list of GUI tools are listed `here on git-scm.com "
"<https://git-scm.com/downloads/guis>`__ but here are a few of the developer "
"favourites:"
msgstr ""
"GUI 工具的完整列表可在 `git-scm.com <https://git-scm.com/downloads/guis>`__ "
"上找到，以下是开发者最喜爱的几款："

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:33 9c3e82d959aa49df9d6fda51d7d7b687
msgid ""
"`GitHub Desktop <https://desktop.github.com/>`__ for Windows and Mac is an "
"easy to use tool with good GitHub integration but has fewer features than "
"other clients."
msgstr ""
"适用于 Windows 和 Mac 的 `GitHub Desktop <https://desktop.github.com/>`__ "
"是一款易于使用且与 GitHub 集成良好的工具，但功能比其他客户端少。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:34 a870690a581a46a589474a5fdeb8d0db
msgid ""
"`Sourcetree for Windows and Mac OSX <https://www.sourcetreeapp.com/>`__ is a"
" full featured tool with a nice interface with many features including "
"allowing individual lines from a file to be included in a new commit "
"(simpler tools only allow the entire file to be included)"
msgstr ""
"适用于 Windows 和 Mac OSX 的 `Sourcetree <https://www.sourcetreeapp.com/>`__ "
"是一款界面友好、功能丰富的工具，支持将文件中的单独行包含在新提交中（较简单的工具只能包含整个文件）。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:35 1856a617b1564802b521776419afbf22
msgid ""
"`GitKraken <https://www.gitkraken.com/>`__ is a a full featured tool for "
"Windows, Mac and Linux"
msgstr ""
"`GitKraken <https://www.gitkraken.com/>`__ 是适用于 Windows、Mac 和 Linux 的全功能工具。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:12
#: fbea6c29b1a64b548b4d182db4e8d9ab
msgid "Clone ArduPilot repository"
msgstr "克隆 ArduPilot 仓库"

#: ../../source/docs/git-clone.rst:3 64266bf1832e4b979afc4bd612b23249
msgid ""
"\"Cloning\" is git's term for making a local copy of a remote repository "
"(i.e. one held on the GitHub servers)."
msgstr "「克隆」是 git 对制作远程仓库（即存放在 GitHub 服务器上的仓库）本地副本的术语。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-clone.rst:5 d26e4de4ec4b44d798b859eb9a1ad6d6
msgid ""
"Developers should clone the main `ArduPilot repository "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__ (if they simply want to download"
" and compile the latest code) or their own :ref:`fork <git-fork>` (if they "
"want to make changes to the source code and potentially submit changes "
"back)."
msgstr ""
"开发者应克隆主 `ArduPilot 仓库 <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__ "
"（如果只是想下载并编译最新代码），或克隆自己的 :ref:`fork <git-fork>` （如果想修改源码并可能提交更改）。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-clone.rst:7 1f66087124794ee6b4a48e445a6eba1f
msgid ""
"Instructions for commonly used tools are below but whichever tool is used, "
"the URL for the source repo will be required.  This can be found on the "
"right side of the screen on each Github repository home page but in general "
"the URL is:"
msgstr "常用工具的使用说明如下，无论使用哪种工具，都需要源仓库的 URL。该 URL 可在每个 Github 仓库主页右侧找到，一般格式为："

#: ../../source/docs/git-clone.rst:9 97f234f4a6ce4f66994a15da7a9ff199
msgid ""
"``https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot.git`` for the main ardupilot repo"
msgstr "``https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot.git`` （ArduPilot 主仓库）"

#: ../../source/docs/git-clone.rst:10 0c45843bbf5b4382a474e6ff584849ad
msgid ""
"``https://github.com/your-github-account/ardupilot`` for your :ref:`fork "
"<git-fork>` of the ardupilot repo"
msgstr ""
"``https://github.com/your-github-account/ardupilot`` （你的 ArduPilot "
":ref:`fork <git-fork>`）"

#: ../../source/docs/git-clone.rst:15 62f244303316466db06dc8543d5b6e34
msgid "Cloning with the command line"
msgstr "使用命令行克隆"

#: ../../source/docs/git-clone.rst:17 8550159e299d4f11b47e268be4d3248f
msgid ""
"open a terminal and navigate to the directory where you would like the clone"
" to be stored"
msgstr "打开终端，切换到你希望存储克隆仓库的目录"

#: ../../source/docs/git-clone.rst:18 52e6d14c686240718dec35c9d840843e
msgid "clone your fork:"
msgstr "克隆你的 fork："

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:20
#: 1ad0721c921a48cd8cf87e867755d388
msgid ""
"In case some firewalls do not allow ssh access which can cause the above "
"submodule updates to fail, in this instance, you can tell git to "
"unilaterally use https through the following command:"
msgstr "如果某些防火墙不允许 SSH 访问，可能导致上述子模块更新失败，此时可以通过以下命令让 git 统一使用 https："

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:26
#: 214b8e1fc4a04f539901f52ddaadc896
msgid "to use https protocols instead of the default git:// prefix."
msgstr "以使用 https 协议代替默认的 git:// 前缀。"

