msgstr "安装所需软件包"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:33
#: f0b19bbdca8e4c5ab8e58a21c3b6931e
msgid ""
"If you are on a debian based system (such as Ubuntu or Mint), we provide `a "
"script "
